1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,800
Today, we're taking FIVE of our bravest friends
to an ACTIVE VOLCANO!

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,456
And there's TEN MILLION DOLLARS waiting
for the LAST PERSON TO SURVIVE!

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,216
Meet Alex, Ryan, Mike, Daniel, and Chris!
Five friends! One volcano! And only ONE
ten-million-dollar winner!

4
00:00:18,416 --> 00:00:20,768
Wait... THAT THING
IS ACTUALLY ERUPTING!

5
00:00:20,968 --> 00:00:23,320
Relax! I'm walking out of here
with ten million!

6
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:26,472
Keep talking, buddy.
Let's see how long you last!

7
00:00:26,672 --> 00:00:32,168
Your mission is simple! Cross the volcanic
survival course, reach the final platform,
and stay in the challenge!

8
00:00:32,368 --> 00:00:36,640
You have TWO MINUTES! And remember...
THE LAST FRIEND STANDING
WINS TEN MILLION DOLLARS!

9
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,696
THREE... TWO... ONE... GO!

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,968
GUYS! WHY IS THE
GROUND MOVING?!

11
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,360
BECAUSE WE'RE RUNNING
ON A VOLCANO, RYAN!

12
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,392
STOP LOOKING BACK!
KEEP MOVING!

13
00:00:49,592 --> 00:00:53,600
The volcano is getting more active, and these
five friends are already running out of time!

14
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,680
ONE AT A TIME!
HOLD THE RAILS!

15
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:59,904
ONE AT A TIME?! I'M NOT EVEN READY
FOR ZERO AT A TIME!

16
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,448
COME ON, RYAN! TEN MILLION
DOLLARS IS WAITING!

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,352
STOP TALKING
AND MOVE!

18
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,928
OH MY GOD!
DID YOU SEE THAT?!

19
00:01:12,128 --> 00:01:15,032
THAT WAS NOT
A SMALL EXPLOSION!

20
00:01:15,232 --> 00:01:16,984
WE NEED TO MOVE!
RIGHT NOW!

21
00:01:17,184 --> 00:01:21,120
THE VOLCANO HAS ERUPTED! AND THE FIVE
FRIENDS ARE STILL IN THE MIDDLE
OF THE CHALLENGE!

22
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,200
CHRIS! NOT THAT WAY!
THE SAFE ROUTE IS OVER HERE!

23
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,648
WE DON'T HAVE TIME!

24
00:01:29,848 --> 00:01:32,704
WE WON'T WIN ANYTHING
IF WE DON'T MAKE IT!

25
00:01:32,904 --> 00:01:34,800
FOR ONCE,
LISTEN TO ALEX!

26
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,696
TWENTY-SEVEN SECONDS!
WE'RE NOT GOING TO MAKE IT!

27
00:01:42,896 --> 00:01:44,096
I CAN'T RUN ANYMORE!

28
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,200
YES, YOU CAN! COME ON!
WE'VE COME TOO FAR!

29
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:54,080
THE CLOCK IS RUNNING OUT! FIVE FRIENDS
STARTED THIS CHALLENGE... BUT ONLY ONE
CAN CLAIM THE PRIZE!

30
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,600
I'M GETTING
THAT TEN MILLION!

31
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,944
NOT IF I GET
THERE FIRST!

32
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,848
FASTER!
FASTER!

33
00:02:02,048 --> 00:02:03,848
WAIT FOR ME!
I'M STILL IN THIS!

34
00:02:04,048 --> 00:02:08,128
TEN SECONDS LEFT! THIS IS INCREDIBLE!
THEY'RE ALL RACING FOR THE FINISH!

35
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:16,312
WE HAVE A WINNER! DANIEL JUST SURVIVED
THE VOLCANO CHALLENGE!

36
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,520
YOU'VE JUST WON
TEN MILLION DOLLARS!

37
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,864
WHAT?! TEN MILLION?!
ARE YOU SERIOUS?!

38
00:02:24,064 --> 00:02:25,912
I CAN'T BELIEVE
HE ACTUALLY WON!

39
00:02:26,112 --> 00:02:29,328
WOULD YOU SURVIVE THIS VOLCANO CHALLENGE?
COMMENT BELOW!

